  "details": "There is a good chunk of the community that does rps and what not of vrchat and some of the QOL features that they used to help be admins or mods for it.\nList includes\n-Flying\n-No Clip\n-ESP(Meaning something to be able to see an outline bubble around a player. Yellow for friends and blue for not friends)\n-An in game clock\n-Implement the SRample Face Tracking\n-Being able to Teleport to players that are in the same instance\n-Adding in a 3rd person view for desktop users as well\nWhat would be cool about it is that when the mods were allowed, world creators could turn off the fly, no clip, esp, and teleport in their map so no one could use it which could still be a thing that is allowed to do by world owner choice. A lot of people used these to dm and moderate their rps. It'd be cool to be able to see these things officially in vrchat.",
